code 57:$82b0 jumps_57_82b0 8 high $82b8   ; (the jump at $82ad)
code $cae2 jumps_62_cae2 7 high $cae9   ; (the jump at $cadf)
code $ce31 jumps_62_ce31 63 high $ce70   ; (the jump at $ce10)
code $ceaf jumps_62_ceaf 9 high $ceb8   ; (the jump at $ce00)

